1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,360
This is the implementation demo for journey six.

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:07,480
It is the real application and API running on this machine,

3
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:13,070
with synthetic people and the local payment adapter, so nothing is ever charged.

4
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:17,690
It shows a buyer going from a car to a confirmed video inspection.

5
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:22,800
A new buyer opens the dashboard and finds no inspections yet.

6
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:25,600
Booking starts with the car and the seller.

7
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:30,540
A short VIN and a short phone number are refused with a list of what to fix.

8
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:35,870
Then the review: choosing both a mechanic and a body shop shows the server's price

9
00:00:35,870 --> 00:00:37,100
of seventy dollars.

10
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:38,010
Next the time.

11
00:00:38,010 --> 00:00:42,170
The page offers only slots that are really free, grouped by day.

12
00:00:42,170 --> 00:00:47,370
Choosing one shows the mechanic, and continuing holds that slot for ten minutes.

13
00:00:47,370 --> 00:00:50,290
Then payment through the same flow as before.

14
00:00:50,290 --> 00:00:55,430
When the payment succeeds, the buyer is booked: the confirmation names the day,

15
00:00:55,430 --> 00:00:57,120
the time and the mechanic.

16
00:00:57,120 --> 00:01:01,470
The inspection shows the car, the time, the team and what was paid,

17
00:01:01,470 --> 00:01:04,460
and the dashboard lists it with its call time.

18
00:01:05,610 --> 00:01:08,280
Booking is safe when things happen at once.

19
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:12,740
When two buyers hold the same slot at the same moment, exactly one wins,

20
00:01:12,740 --> 00:01:17,460
and the other is told that the slot was just taken, and keeps their answers.

21
00:01:17,460 --> 00:01:22,290
When a booking is confirmed five times at once, there is still one inspection.

22
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:24,910
There is one more case.

23
00:01:24,910 --> 00:01:27,770
If a buyer pays after their hold has expired,

24
00:01:27,770 --> 00:01:32,290
and someone else took the slot in the meantime, the booking is refused,

25
00:01:32,290 --> 00:01:35,480
and the payment is refunded in full automatically.

26
00:01:35,480 --> 00:01:38,980
The buyer is never charged for a time they cannot have.

27
00:01:38,980 --> 00:01:41,470
This is covered by the automated tests.

28
00:01:42,620 --> 00:01:44,320
Here is what to remember.

29
00:01:44,320 --> 00:01:46,510
A booking is hold, pay, confirm.

30
00:01:46,510 --> 00:01:50,400
Only free slots are offered, and a slot can be held once.

31
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:53,470
A paid checkout makes exactly one inspection,

32
00:01:53,470 --> 00:01:56,950
which keeps the vehicle details it was booked with.

33
00:01:56,950 --> 00:02:00,500
Next, journey seven: reschedule or cancel a booking.
